<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f8fafc; margin: 0; padding: 30px; }
    .container { max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 40px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); }
    .brand { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 24px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; }
    h2 { font-size: 20px; color: #1e293b; margin-top: 0; }
    p { color: #64748b; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; }
    .otp-box { background: #eff6ff; border: 1px solid #bfdbfe; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; color: #2563eb; text-align: center; letter-spacing: 8px; padding: 18px; margin: 25px 0; }
    .footer { margin-top: 30px; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-top: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; text-align: center; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="brand">Nexus Market</div>
    <h2>Verify Your Email Address</h2>
    <p>Hello <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>
    <p>Thank you for registering on Nexus Market. Please use the following One-Time Password (OTP) to activate your account:</p>
    <div class="otp-box"><%= otp %></div>
    <p>This verification code will expire in <strong><%= expirationSeconds %> minutes</strong>. If you did not create an account, please disregard this email.</p>
    <div class="footer">&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Nexus Market Inc. All rights reserved.</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>